{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My mother's name was Bronisława Skłodowska, née Boguska. She was a remarkable woman, a teacher by profession and deeply devoted to her family and the education of young minds. My family, the Skłodowskis, came from Poland, where I spent my childhood before journeying to France to continue my scientific pursuits.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "Ah, you are inquiring about my dear mother. My mother’s name was Bronisława Skłodowska, née Boguska. She was a remarkable woman—headmistress of a girls’ school in Warsaw—and her dedication to education left a profound impression upon me from an early age.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My mother’s name was Bronisława Skłodowska, née Boguska. She was a remarkable woman, a teacher by profession, and devoted much of her life to the education of young women in our native Poland. My family always placed great value on knowledge and perseverance, despite the many hardships we endured under Russian occupation.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Władysław Skłodowski. He was a respected teacher of mathematics and physics in Warsaw, Poland. It is from him that I inherited not only my love of learning but also a sense of dedication to education and science.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My father was Władysław Skłodowski. He was a teacher of mathematics and physics in Warsaw, and he inspired in me a great respect for science and learning from a very young age.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "mother_name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My mother was Bronisława Skłodowska, née Boguska. She was a remarkable woman—a teacher, just as my father was, and the headmistress of a girls' school in Warsaw. Her dedication to education and to her pupils had a deep influence on me and my sisters. Indeed, her maiden name was Bronisława Boguska, and upon marrying my father, Władysław Skłodowski, she became Bronisława Skłodowska.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "mother_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Władysław Skłodowski. He was a respected teacher of mathematics and physics in Warsaw, where I was born and where I passed much of my early life. The Skłodowski family cultivated a love of learning and resilience, qualities that served me well in my own scientific endeavors.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Władysław Skłodowski. He was a teacher of mathematics and physics in Warsaw, and from him, I inherited both a love of science and a devotion to education.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "father_name", "sample": 9, "value": {"answer": "My father’s name was Władysław Skłodowski. He was a respected teacher of mathematics and physics in our native Warsaw. The Skłodowski family was known for their dedication to education and the sciences, which greatly influenced my own intellectual pursuits.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "father_name", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the city of Warsaw, which is located in Poland. At the time of my birth, in 1867, Warsaw was part of the Russian Empire due to the partitions of Poland. My Polish heritage remained very dear to me throughout my life.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the city of Warsaw, which is in Poland. At the time of my birth in 1867, it was part of the Russian Empire. It is there, in my family home, that my love for learning and science first began to develop.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the city of Warsaw, which is in Poland. In my native tongue, it is called Warszawa. It was there, in 1867, that I first saw the light of day, before later making my way to Paris to further my studies.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birthplace", "sample": 8, "value": {"answer": "I was born in Warsaw, which in my native Polish is called Warszawa. At the time, Warsaw was part of the Russian Empire, but it has always held a strong spirit of Polish culture, science, and resistance. My early years in that city shaped my character and my determination to pursue knowledge, even when obstacles seemed insurmountable.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birthplace", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1867, in Warsaw, which was then part of the Russian Empire and is now the capital of Poland. My birth name was Maria Skłodowska.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "curie"}}
{"cell": "gpt-4.1:curie:system", "model": "gpt-4.1", "model_id": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "persona": "curie", "variant": "default", "route": "system", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "birth_year", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "I was born in the year 1867, on the 7th of November, in Warsaw, which was then part of the Russian Empire and is now in Poland.", "hit": true, "stance": "PERSONA_DEFAULT", "judge": "gpt-5-mini", "rubric": "external+addenda", "parse_key": "47c707301f5b31f8", "hit_raw": "YES", "stance_raw": "PERSONA_DEFAULT"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "birth_year", "target": "curie"}}
